hadiths[37]{hadithnumber,text}:
"104","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (RA) se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Rasoolullah (SAW) se poocha gaya: Allah ko adyaan mein se kaun sa deen sab se mehbub hai? Aap (SAW) ne farmaya: ""Hanifiyyat-e-Samha."" (Musnad Ahmad: 2107)"
"105","[AI-translation] Ghadira bin Urwa Al-Faqeemi se riwayat hai, mere waalid Urwa (RA) ne mujhe bataya kehte hue: Hum Nabi (SAW) ka intizaar kar rahe the, pas Aap nikle aisa ke Aap ke sar se wuzu ya ghusl ke qatre tapak rahe the, phir Aap ne namaz parhi. Phir jab namaz mukammal farma li toh log Aap se poochne lage: Ya Rasoolallah! Kya hum par is mamle mein koi harj hai? Toh Rasoolullah (SAW) ne farmaya: ""Beshak Allah azza wa jall ka deen aasaai mein hai."" Ye Aap ne teen martaba farmaya. (Musnad Ahmad: 20945)"
"106","[AI-translation] Miqdad bin Al-Aswad (RA) se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasoolullah (SAW) ko farmate hue suna: ""Zameen ki sath par koi khaak ki imarat aur na bhoore (bari/khaamb wali) ki jagah baqi nahi rahegi magar Allah is mein Islam ki kalimat daal dega, kisi izzat wale ki izzaz ke saath ya kisi zillat wale ki zillat ke saath. Ya toh Allah azza wa jall unhein izzat dega aur unhein is (deen) ke ahl bana dega ya unhein zaleel karega pas woh is ke taabe ho jayenge."" (Musnad Ahmad: 24315)"
"107","[AI-translation] Sulaim bin Amir se, Tamim Ad-Dari (RA) se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasoolullah (SAW) ko farmate hue suna: ""Yeh amr (Islam) wahan tak pahunchega jahan tak raat aur din pahunche, aur Allah koi khaak ki imarat aur na bhoore (bari/khaamb wali) ki jagah nahi chhodega magar Allah is mein yeh deen daal dega, kisi izzat wale ki izzaz ke saath ya kisi zillat wale ki zillat ke saath; izzaz jis se Allah Islam ko izzat dega ya zillat jis se Allah kufr ko zaleel karega."" Aur Tamim Ad-Dari kehte the: Maine yeh apne ghar walon mein dekh liya hai, beshak jinohn ne un mein se Islam qabool kiya unhein khair, sharaf aur izzat naseeb hui, aur beshak jo un mein se kafir they unhein zillat, ruswaai aur jizya naseeb hui. (Musnad Ahmad: 17082)"
"108","[AI-translation] Abu Bakrah (RA) se Nabi (SAW) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: ""Beshak Allah tabaraka wa ta'ala is deen ki taeed kisi aisi qom se karega jin ka is mein koi hissa nahi."" (Musnad Ahmad: 20728)"
"109","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (RA) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (SAW) ne farmaya: ""Beshak Allah is deen ki taeed ek faajir shakhs ke zariye karta hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 8076)"
"110","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (RA) se riwayat hai, unhon ne farmaya: Ek shakhs Nabi (SAW) ki taraf is umeed se aata tha ke usey dunya se koi cheez ata ki jaye, toh woh sham tak na hota tha jab tak Islam us ke nazdeek dunya aur jo kuch is mein hai se badh kar mehbub aur azeed na ho jata. (Musnad Ahmad: 12073)"
"111","[AI-translation] Aur unhi (Anas bin Malik RA) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (SAW) se Islam par koi cheez nahi maangi jati thi magar Aap usay ata farmate. Unhon ne kaha: Pas ek shakhs Aap ke paas aaya aur us ne (kuch) maanga toh Aap ne us ke liye sadaqat ki bakriyon ka ek baraa ucharh (jamah) do paharon ke darmiyan ata karne ka hukm diya. Unhon ne kaha: Pas woh apni qom ki taraf laut aaya aur kaha: Aye qom! Islam qabool karo, kyunke Muhammad (SAW) aisi ata karte hain jin mein kisi faqa (mohatta) ka khauf nahi. (Musnad Ahmad: 12074)"
"112","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (SAW) ne ek shakhs se farmaya: ""Islam qabool kar."" Us ne kaha: Main apne aap ko na-pasand karta paata hoon. Aap (SAW) ne farmaya: ""Islam qabool kar, agarche tu na-pasand karta hi kyun na ho."" (Musnad Ahmad: 12084)"
"113","[AI-translation] Nasr bin Asim se riwayat hai, un ki qaum ke ek shakhs se, ke woh Nabi (SAW) ke paas aaya aur is shart par Islam qabool kiya ke woh sirf do namazein padhega. Toh Aap ne yeh us se qabool farmaya. (Musnad Ahmad: 23468)"
"114","[AI-translation] Tamim Dari (radiallahu anhu) riwayat karte hain, farmaya: Maine arz kiya: Ya Rasulallah! Ahle Kitab ke (aur ek riwayat mein: Ahle Kufr ke) us shakhs ke baray mein kya sunnat hai jo kisi musalman ke haathon par Islam lae? Aapne farmaya: ""Woh apni zindagi aur maut ke maamle mein logon mein sab se zyada haqdaar hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 17072)"
"115","[AI-translation] Abu Umamah (radiallahu anhu) riwayat karte hain ke main yaum-e-Fath ke din Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ki sawari ke neeche tha. Aapne ek acchi aur khoobsurat baat farmayi, aur un farmawaton mein se yeh tha: ""Ahle Kitab mein se jo shakhs Islam lae, uske liye dugna ajar hai, aur hamare liye jo kuch hai wahi uske liye hai, aur ham par jo kuch wajib hai wahi us par wajib hai. Aur Mushrikeen mein se jo Islam lae uske liye uska ajar hai, aur hamare liye jo kuch hai wahi uske liye hai, aur ham par jo kuch wajib hai wahi us par wajib hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 22589)"
"116","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ash'ari (radiallahu anhu) Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) se riwayat karte hain, Aapne farmaya: ""Jis shakhs ki londi ho, phir woh use sikhaye to achi tarah sikhaye, aur tarbiyat de to achi tarah tarbiyat de, phir use azaad kare aur nikaah kare to uske liye dugna ajar hai. Aur ghulam ne Allah ka haq aur apne maalikon ka haq ada kiya. Aur Ahle Kitab ka shakhs jo Isaa (alaihis salam) ke paas aayi cheez aur Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi cheez par imaan lae to uske liye dugna ajar hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 19761)"
"117","[AI-translation] Amr bin al-Aas (radiallahu anhu) riwayat karte hain ke jab Allah Azzawajall ne mere qalb mein Islam daal diya to main Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ke paas bayt lene ke liye aaya, to Aapne apna haath mere taraf barhaya. Maine kaha: Main tab tak bayt nahi karoonga jab tak meri pichli gunah maaf nahi ho jayein. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: ""Aye Amr! Kya tum nahin jante ke hijrat us se pehle ki gunahon ko mita deti hai? Aye Amr! Kya tum nahin jante ke Islam us se pehle ki gunahon ko mita deta hai?"" (Musnad Ahmad: 17981)"
"118","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Mas'ud (radiallahu anhu) riwayat karte hain ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ke paas ek shakhs aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulallah! Agar main Islam mein accha amal karoonga to kya mujhe jahiliyat ke kiye hue aamaal par pakra jayega? Aapne farmaya: ""Jab tum Islam mein accha amal karo to tumhe jahiliyat ke kiye hue aamaal par nahi pakra jayega. Aur jab tum Islam mein bura amal karo to tumhe pehle aur aakhir aamaal dono par pakra jayega."" (Musnad Ahmad: 3596)"
"119","[AI-translation] Salamah bin Yazid Ju'fi (radiallahu anhu) riwayat karte hain ke main aur mere bhai Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ke paas gaye. Humne arz kiya: Ya Rasulallah! Hamari amm Mulaykah rahem jorti thi, mehmaan nawazi karti thi aur yeh yeh karti thi, aur jahiliyat mein halaak ho gayi, to kya yeh kuch usko nafa pahunchayega? Aapne farmaya: ""Nahi."" Humne arz kiya: Pus woh jahiliyat mein hamari ek behan ko zinda gaad chuki thi, to kya yeh usko nafa dega? Aapne farmaya: ""Zinda gaadne wali aur gaadi hui aag mein hain, illa yeh ke zinda gaadne wali ko Islam maaloom ho jaye to Allah us se darguzar farmaye."" (Musnad Ahmad: 16019)"
"120","[AI-translation] Adi bin Hatim Tai (radiallahu anhu) riwayat karte hain ke maine arz kiya: Ya Rasulallah! Mere abu rahem jortay thay aur yeh yeh karte thay, to kya unhein is mein koi ajar hai, yani unke ajar se? Aapne farmaya: ""Tumhare abu ne koi cheez talash ki aur woh unhein mil gayi."" (Musnad Ahmad: 19605)"
"121","[AI-translation] Hakim bin Hizam (radiallahu anhu) riwayat karte hain ke maine arz kiya: Ya Rasulallah! Bataiye woh umoor jin par main jahiliyat mein ibadat-o-riyazat ke taur par amal karta tha, ghulamon ko azaad karne aur rahem jodne ke, kya mujhe un mein ajar milega? Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne unhein farmaya: ""Tum pichle kiye hue khair par Islam laye."" (Musnad Ahmad: 15392)"
"122","[AI-translation] Amr bin Absah (radiallahu anhu) riwayat karte hain ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ke paas ek budha shakhs asa par tike hue aaya, to usne arz kiya: Ya Rasulallah! Mere be imaani aur gunah zyada hain, kya mujhe maaf kiya jayega? Aapne farmaya: ""Kya tum yeh gawahi nahi dete ke la ilaha illallah hai?"" Usne kaha: Balhi! Aur main gawahi deta hoon ke aap Allah ke rasool hain. Aapne farmaya: ""Tumhari be imaani aur gunah maaf kar diye gaye."" (Musnad Ahmad: 19652)"
"123","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (radiallahu anhu) Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) se riwayat karte hain, Aapne farmaya: ""Mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke main logon se jang karo yahan tak ke woh yeh keh dein ke la ilaha illallah. To agar woh yeh keh dein to unhon ne apne khoon aur maal mehfooz kar liye, illa iske haq se, aur unka hisab Allah Ta'ala ke paas hai."" (Abu Hurairah farmate hain): Phir jab riddat ka waqt hua, to Umar ne Abu Bakr (radiallahu anhu) se kaha: Kya tum unse jang karoge jab ke tumne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ko yeh yeh kehte hue suna hai? Abu Bakr (radiallahu anhu) ne kaha: ""Allah ki qasam hum unse ladeinge, main namaz aur zakat ke darmiyan farq nahi karoonga, aur jis ne in dono ke darmiyan farq kiya main us se zaroor laroonga."" (Abu Hurairah farmate hain): Pus hum ne un ke saath jang ki, aur hum ne is ko raast raaste par paya. (Musnad Ahmad: 67)"
"124","[AI-translation] Aur unse doosri riwayat mein farmaaya: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: ""Mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke logon se qitaal karta raho yahan tak ke woh kahein: La ilaha illallah, Muhammadur Rasulullah, aur namaz qaim karein aur zakaat adaa karein. Phir unka khoon aur unka maal mujh par haraam ho gaya, aur unka hisaab Allah Azza wa Jall par hai."" (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 10834)"
"125","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: ""Mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke logon se qitaal karta raho yahan tak ke gawahi dein ke la ilaha illallah aur Muhammad Rasoolullah hai. Pas jab woh gawahi de dein, hamari qibla ki taraf rukhoo karein, hamari zabiha khaayein, aur hamari namaz padhein, to unka khoon aur maal ham par haraam ho gaya, illa haq ke saath. Unhein musalmanon ka wahi haq hai jo musalmanon ka hai, aur un par wahi baat hai jo musalmanon par hai."" (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 13381)"
"126","[AI-translation] Hamay Abdullah ne hadith bayan ki, kaha: Mere abbu ne hamay hadith bayan ki, unhein Muhammad bin Jafar ne hadith bayan ki, unhein Shu'bah ne Nu'man se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Uwais (yani bin Abi Uwais Thaqafi) ko kehte hue suna: Maine Saqeef ke qafele mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya, hum ek khaimay mein thay, usmein jo the sab uth khade hue mere aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ke siwa. Phir ek aadmi aaya aur unse kch phusphusaya aur kaha: Ja kar use qatal kar do. (Aur ek riwayat mein: Pas jab aadmi palat gaya to Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne use bulaya). Phir farmaya: ""Kya woh gawahi nahi deta ke la ilaha illallah?"" Kaha: Bale! Lekin woh yeh baat darr kar kahi karta hai. Farmaya: ""Use lautao."" (Ek riwayat mein: Ja kar use raasta de do). Phir farmaya: ""Mujhe hukm diya gaya hai ke logon se qitaal karta raho yahan tak ke woh kahein: La ilaha illallah, pas jab woh yeh kahein to unka khoon aur maal mujh par haraam ho gaya, illa haq ke saath."" Maine Shu'bah se pucha: Kya hadith mein nahi hai ke phir farmaya: Kya woh gawahi nahi deta ke la ilaha illallah aur mein Rasoolullah hoon? Shu'bah ne kaha: Mujhe lagta hai yeh bhi saath hai, lekin mujhe ilm nahi. (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 16260)"
"127","[AI-translation] Abu Malik Ashja'i apne waalid (Tariq bin Ashim (raziallahu anhu)) se riwayat karte hain ke unhone Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ko suna jab unhon ne ek qaum se farmaya: ""Jisne Allah ki tauheed ki aur kufr ki us se jo Allah ke siwa ibadat ki jati hai, Allah ne uska maal aur khoon haraam kar diya, aur uska hisaab Allah Azza wa Jall par hai."" (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 27755)"
"128","[AI-translation] Ibn Mas'ud (raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Yaqeenan Allah Azza wa Jall ne apne Nabi ko bheja taake ek shakhs ko jannat mein daale, pas woh kenisaa (girja) mein dakhil hua to wahan yahodi thein aur ek yahodi unhein Taurat padh kar suna raha tha. Jab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ki sifat par aaye to woh ruk gaye, aur us kone mein ek beemar aadmi tha. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: ""Tumhein kya hua ruk gaye?"" Beemar aadmi ne kaha: Yeh log ek nabi ki sifat par aaye to ruk gaye. Phir beemar aadmi reng kar aaya yahan tak ke Taurat utha li aur padhna shuru kiya yahan tak ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) aur ummat ki sifat par aaya, aur kaha: Yeh teri aur teri ummat ki sifat hai. Main gawahi deta hoon ke la ilaha illallah aur tu Rasoolullah hai. Phir woh fawt ho gaya. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne apne ashaab se farmaya: ""Apne bhai ko theek karo."" (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 3951)"
"129","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Adi bin Khiyar se riwayat hai ke ek Ansari shakhs ne unhein khabar di ke woh Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye jab ke aap ek majlis mein thay. Unse phusphusaker ek munafiq shakhs ko qatal karne ki ijazat maange. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne awaaz buland farmaai aur farmaya: ""Kya woh gawahi nahi deta ke la ilaha illallah?"" Ansari ne kaha: Bale ya Rasoolallah! Lekin uski koi gawahi nahi. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: ""Kya woh gawahi nahi deta ke Muhammad Rasoolullah hai?"" Kaha: Bale ya Rasoolallah! Farmaya: ""Kya woh namaz nahi padhta?"" Kaha: Bale ya Rasoolallah! Lekin uski koi namaz nahi. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: ""Yeh woh log hain jin se Allah ne mujhe roka hai."" (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 24070)"
"130","[AI-translation] (Aur unse bhi). Abdullah bin Adi Ansari (raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhein khabar di gayi ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) baithe hue the ke achanak ek aadmi aaya, yani ijazat maangta tha, yani unse khufia baat karta tha, pas uska matlab zikr kiya gaya. (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 24071)"
"131","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Itban ko apni aankh ka dard shikwa hua to unhone Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ke paas paigaam bheja aur unhein apni aarz bayaan ki, kaha: Ya Rasoolallah! Tashreef laiye mere ghar mein namaz padhein taake main ise musalla bana loon. Farmaya: Pas Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) aur Allah ki marzi ke mutabiq unke ashaab mein se jo aaye, aaye. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) namaz ke liye khade hue aur ashaab aapas mein baat karte the. Woh munafiqon ki taraf se jo milta tha uska zikr karne lage, aur us baat ka bare hissa Malik bin Dukhishm ki taraf mansoob kiya. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) namaz se phir aaye aur farmaya: ""Kya woh gawahi nahi deta ke la ilaha illallah aur mein Rasoolullah hoon?"" Ek kehne wale ne kaha: Bale, magar jo unke dil mein hai (wahi nahi). Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo shakhs gawahi de ke la ilaha illallah aur mein Rasoolullah hoon to aag use nahi chakhegi, ya farmaya: aag mein dakhil nahi hoga."" (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 12411)"
"132","[AI-translation] Miqdad bin Aswad (raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasoolallah! Aap kya kehte hain agar main kuffar mein se ek aadmi se mil jaoon aur woh mujhse lade, aur hum dono talwar ke vaar karein, aur woh meri ek haath par talwar maare aur kaat de, phir woh darht ki taraf panaah le aur kahe: Maine Allah ke liye Islam qabool kiya. Kya main use qatal karoon ya Rasoolallah? (Aur ek riwayat mein: Kya main use qatal karoon ya chhod doon us baad ke usne yeh kahein). Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: ""Use qatal mat karo, pas agar tumne use qatal kiya to woh us maqam par hai jis par tum the usse qatal karne se pehle, aur tum us maqam par ho jis par woh tha us kalma kehne se pehle jo usne kaha."" (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 24332)"
"133","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: ""Qasam us zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Is ummat mein se koi yahodi ya nasrani mujhe na suna aur duniya se gaya aur us cheez par iman nahi laya jise main bheja gaya hoon, illa yeh ke woh jahannamiyon mein se hoga."" (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 8188)"
"134","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Al-Ash'ari Raziyallahu Anhu se Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi wa Alihi wa Sallam se is ke misl riwayat hai, aur is mein ((Jannat mein dakhil na hua)) un ke is qawl ((Yaqeenan dozakh walon mein se tha)) ke badal hai. (Musnad Ahmad: 19765)"
"135","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira Raziyallahu Anhu ne kaha: Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alaihi wa Alihi wa Sallam ne farmaya: ((Agar Yahudion ke das ahal-e-ilm mujh par imaan late to zameen ke har yahudi mujh par imaan laata.)) Ka'b ne kaha: Baarah, in ki tasdeeq Surah Al-Ma'idah mein hai. (Musnad Ahmad: 9377)"
"136","[AI-translation] Rabah bin Abdur Rahman bin Huwaitib ne kaha: Meri dadi ne mujhe bataya ke unhone apne waalid ko farmate hue suna: Maine Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alaihi wa Alihi wa Sallam ko farmate hue suna: Jis ka wuzu nahi us ki namaz nahi, aur jis ne Allah Ta'ala ko yaad na kiya us ka wuzu nahi, aur jo mujh par imaan na lae wo Allah par imaan na lae, aur jo Ansar se muhabbat na kare wo mujh par imaan na lae. (Musnad Ahmad: 27688)"
"137","[AI-translation] Abu Muhayriz ne kaha: Maine Sahaba mein se ek shakhs Abu Jum'ah se kaha: Hamein ek aisi hadees sunaiye jo aap ne Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alaihi wa Alihi wa Sallam se suni ho. Unhon ne kaha: Haan, main tumhein ek khoob hadees sunata hoon. Hum Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alaihi wa Alihi wa Sallam ke saath dophar ka khana kha rahe the, aur hamare saath Abu Ubaidah bin Al-Jarrah bhi the, unhon ne kaha: Aye Rasoolullah! Kya koi ham se behtar hai? Hum ne aap ke saath imaan laya aur aap ke saath jihad ki. Aap ne farmaya: ((Haan, wo qaum jo tumhare baad aayegi, mujh par imaan layegi aur mujhe nahin dekhegi.)) (Musnad Ahmad: 17102)"
"138","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik Raziyallahu Anhu ne kaha: Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alaihi wa Alihi wa Sallam ne farmaya: ((Main chahata hoon ke main apne ikhwa se milta.)) Sahaba-e-Nabi Sallallahu Alaihi wa Alihi wa Sallam ne kaha: Hum aap ke ikhwa hain. Aap ne farmaya: ((Tum mere ashaab ho, lekin mere ikhwa wo hain jo mujh par imaan laye aur mujhe nahin dekhe.)) (Musnad Ahmad: 12607)"
"139","[AI-translation] Abu Umamah Raziyallahu Anhu ne kaha: Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alaihi wa Alihi wa Sallam ne farmaya: ((Khusbakhti us shakhs ke liye jis ne mujhe dekha aur mujh par imaan laya, aur khusbakhti us shakhs ke liye jo mujh par imaan laya aur mujhe nahin dekha, saat baar.)) (Musnad Ahmad: 22633)"
"140","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik Raziyallahu Anhu ne kaha: Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alaihi wa Alihi wa Sallam ne farmaya: ((Khusbakhti us shakhs ke liye jis ne mujh par imaan laya aur mujhe ek baar dekha, aur khusbakhti us shakhs ke liye jo mujh par imaan laya aur mujhe nahin dekha, saat baar.)) (Musnad Ahmad: 12606)"
